      "desc:8": "§6Machine type: §aElectrolyzer / Centrifuge§r\n\nThe lightning seemed to roll down a ladder.\nSeparate the molecules one by one with tweezers.\nExtra 24x Parallel per Piece. 16 Piece enable Perfect Overclock.\nAdditional 10% reduction in time per Voltage Tier, multiplication calculus.\nThe Glass Tier limit the Energy hatch voltage Tier.\nUse screwdriver to change mode.\n\n[note]Hatches[/note]: Input Bus, Input Hatch, Output Bus, Output Hatch, Energy Hatch\n[note]Structure[/note]: Tiered glass (limits the energy hatch tier); Cosmic Neutronium Frame Boxes; the casings in the optional task.\nUse a Hologram Projector (or the NEI structure preview) to see and auto-build the structure.\n\n[note]Controller recipe[/note]: Assembly Line, UHV\nResearch item: Electrolyzer UV\n - 16x Casing MAX\n - 64x Electrolyzer UV\n - 64x Centrifuge UV\n - 16x Carbon Nanites\n - 64x Cosmic Neutronium Frame Box\n - 16x Emitter UV\n - 8x Field Generator UV\n - 32x Electric Pump UV\n - 80x UHV Circuit\n - 128x Osmiridium Dense Plate\n - 64x High Energy Flow Circuit\n - 64x Superconductor UV 4x Wire\n - 36,864 L Solder plasma\n - 36,864 L Molten Osmiridium\n - 64,000 L UU Matter\n - 128,000x Super Coolant",
